# Design Documents

- English only -- do not create `_zh.md` translations for design docs
- Follow the existing format: title, rationale sections, Go/JSON code snippets, handler descriptions, test specifications
- See `docs/design-doc/card-rescheduling.md` as the reference template

## Markdown Lint Compliance

- Use **headings** (e.g. `### Section title`) for section titles, not bold/italic (MD036).
- Use **spaces** for indentation only; no hard tabs (MD010).
- Use **at most one** consecutive blank line between blocks (MD012).
